    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>SlidePDF allows you to embed PDF documents into a Swiper-based slider. It supports:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple pages rendered as slides</li>\n<li>Configurable slides per view, spacing, and looping</li>\n<li>Shortcode usage: <code>[slidepdf src=\"URL\"]</code></li>\n<li>Elementor widget integration with URL or Media Library selection</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20use%20a%20pdf%20from%20the%20media%20library%3F\">\nCan I use a PDF from the Media Library?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, the Elementor widget supports selecting a PDF from the Media Library. For shortcodes, provide a direct URL.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20do%20i%20control%20the%20number%20of%20slides%20per%20page%3F\">\nHow do I control the number of slides per page?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Use the <code>slides_per_view</code> attribute in the shortcode or the corresponding control in the Elementor widget.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"what%20packages%20are%20included%20with%20the%20plugin%3F\">\nWhat packages are included with the plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The plugin uses <a href=\"https://swiperjs.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">SwiperJS</a> for the slider functionality and <a href=\"https://mozilla.github.io/pdf.js/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">PDF.js</a> to render PDF files in the browser.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"where%20can%20i%20customize%20the%20plugin%3F\">\nWhere can I customize the plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>In Tools -&gt; SlidePDF admin page.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial public release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "SlidePDF is a simple way to embed PDFs to your site in a simple slider view.",
    "description": "<p>SlidePDF allows you to embed PDF documents into a Swiper-based slider. It supports:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple pages rendered as slides</li>\n<li>Configurable slides per view, spacing, and looping</li>\n<li>Shortcode usage: <code>[slidepdf src=\"URL\"]</code></li>\n<li>Elementor widget integration with URL or Media Library selection</li>\n</ul>\n",
